1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 18=

4
00:01:10,070 --> 00:01:12,430
(Why does everything seem
reversed from the last lifetime?)

5
00:01:14,350 --> 00:01:16,480
It's not as if you'll actually be
washing rice and tending the fire.

6
00:01:16,790 --> 00:01:18,840
Showing up in person
for disaster relief is merely

7
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:20,760
a display of benevolence
to earn the people's praise.

8
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:22,480
Why are you dressed so plainly?

9
00:01:25,350 --> 00:01:27,350
Just because
I've always lived in luxury,

10
00:01:27,790 --> 00:01:28,840
you assume

11
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:31,120
I wouldn't serve the displaced people
a bowl of hot porridge

12
00:01:31,310 --> 00:01:33,310
to spare them even a moment of hunger?

13
00:01:35,430 --> 00:01:36,200
(He Xiaoyuan.)

14
00:01:36,510 --> 00:01:37,680
(When will you understand?)

15
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:39,200
When the Crown Prince
personally oversees disaster relief,

16
00:01:39,870 --> 00:01:42,000
it's to put on a display of benevolence
for the people's praise,

17
00:01:42,070 --> 00:01:44,280
not to actually
wash rice and tend the fire.

18
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:45,710
But

19
00:01:45,710 --> 00:01:48,200
I just want to serve them
porridge myself for once

20
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:50,680
and spare those people
even a moment of hunger and cold.

21
00:01:52,590 --> 00:01:53,680
This is my game to play.

22
00:01:54,430 --> 00:01:56,350
You don't get to change
the pieces as you please.

23
00:01:56,710 --> 00:01:57,400
Go change.

24
00:01:58,590 --> 00:01:59,680
(Deep down,)

25
00:01:59,790 --> 00:02:01,430
(he really does still
retain traces of his last lifetime.)

26
00:02:01,870 --> 00:02:03,790
(If I keep triggering his instincts,)

27
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,480
(there's hope
he'll regain his memories.)

28
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,280
That's

29
00:02:09,710 --> 00:02:11,150
a first, coming

30
00:02:11,310 --> 00:02:12,080
from you.

31
00:02:12,750 --> 00:02:13,470
In that case,

32
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:16,470
why don't you put
your fine robes back on?

33
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,430
As a future Crown Princess

34
00:02:17,430 --> 00:02:19,630
from humble beginnings,
dressing like this

35
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:21,080
would make me look
as if I'd forgotten my roots.

36
00:02:21,710 --> 00:02:22,590
That's none of your concern.

37
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,080
There's an outfit right here.

38
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:27,840
Come on.

39
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,360
Put it on.

40
00:02:30,630 --> 00:02:31,430
He Xiaoyuan.

41
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:32,630
Have you lost your mind?

42
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:35,750
Put it on.

43
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:38,870
Change.

44
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,080
What are you doing?

45
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:41,430
Take it off.

46
00:02:41,430 --> 00:02:42,000
Let go.

47
00:02:42,310 --> 00:02:43,080
Let go!

48
00:02:43,430 --> 00:02:44,430
Take it off!

49
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,360
- I'm not changing.
- Go change.

50
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:49,560
(What's going on?)

51
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:52,190
(The bond that made us
share each other's injuries)

52
00:02:52,190 --> 00:02:53,310
(seems to have disappeared.)

53
00:02:54,310 --> 00:02:55,120
(Could it be)

54
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:57,840
(because he's starting
to remember something?)

55
00:03:04,470 --> 00:03:05,280
(I'm not changing.)

56
00:03:06,470 --> 00:03:07,400
Go change.

57
00:03:08,390 --> 00:03:11,780
♪Returning to familiar places,
the flowers still bloom♪

58
00:03:12,320 --> 00:03:14,980
♪The night is as deep as your eyes♪

59
00:03:15,780 --> 00:03:17,490
♪Through all these waves of sorrow♪

60
00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:18,230
(What's going on?)

61
00:03:20,590 --> 00:03:21,800
Do you remember anything?

62
00:03:22,590 --> 00:03:23,400
About us...

63
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,190
Your Highness.

64
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:25,960
Crown Princess.

65
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,150
We've arrived
at the disaster relief camp.

66
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,280
Get out.

67
00:03:34,590 --> 00:03:36,150
(Looks like he still doesn't remember.)

68
00:03:40,310 --> 00:03:41,120
Thank you.

69
00:03:41,470 --> 00:03:42,120
Thank you.

70
00:03:42,310 --> 00:03:43,280
Next.

71
00:03:43,750 --> 00:03:44,560
Thank you.

72
00:03:46,590 --> 00:03:47,310
This is yours.

73
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,310
Thank you.

74
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,310
Put it here.

75
00:03:52,190 --> 00:03:53,000
Crown Princess.

76
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,080
Next.

77
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:54,910
Didn't you say

78
00:03:54,910 --> 00:03:56,190
the Princess was having tea
at her residence?

79
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,080
Careful, it's hot.

80
00:03:57,190 --> 00:03:57,660
Thank you.

81
00:03:57,660 --> 00:03:58,480
(What's going on?)

82
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,080
(In the last lifetime, Yun Fang)

83
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,190
(never came here either.)

84
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:02,870
Here you go.

85
00:04:03,910 --> 00:04:04,710
Thank you.

86
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:08,910
Easy.

87
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:10,280
Your Highness.

88
00:04:10,750 --> 00:04:11,560
Thank you.

89
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:16,190
Thank you.

90
00:04:17,270 --> 00:04:18,070
You're such a kind soul.

91
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:20,190
I saw so many displaced people
a few days ago,

92
00:04:20,190 --> 00:04:21,190
and it weighed heavily on my heart.

93
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:22,480
As a princess,

94
00:04:22,630 --> 00:04:23,510
I ought to do something.

95
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:25,920
I see.

96
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,510
I was worried Your Highness
wouldn't allow me to come,

97
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:29,120
so I told a little lie.

98
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:31,950
Xiaoyuan.

99
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:33,390
Why did you come with Boqing?

100
00:04:40,830 --> 00:04:42,560
The Crown Prince
is busy with official matters

101
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,510
and couldn't come in person.

102
00:04:43,830 --> 00:04:44,480
So

103
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,680
I came in his place
to see how things are

104
00:04:45,750 --> 00:04:47,480
and set an example for the people.

105
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:48,480
Besides,

106
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,830
I told him

107
00:04:50,070 --> 00:04:51,390
I was having tea with you.

108
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,800
I'll go help make the porridge first.

109
00:04:57,750 --> 00:04:58,800
Madam, let me.

110
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,000
Here you go.

111
00:05:07,950 --> 00:05:08,600
Thank you.

112
00:05:11,830 --> 00:05:13,240
We're out of porridge. I'll get more.

113
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:17,160
I'll do it.

114
00:05:19,070 --> 00:05:19,680
It's hot.

115
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,160
Your Highness.

116
00:05:35,270 --> 00:05:36,040
You've burned yourself.

117
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:37,510
You need to return to the palace
and apply ice immediately.

118
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:42,240
No need.

119
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,390
It's nothing.

120
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:50,360
Here.

121
00:06:01,190 --> 00:06:01,800
Drink up.

122
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,160
Careful, it's hot.

123
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:08,510
Next.

124
00:06:10,950 --> 00:06:12,510
(He really took to heart)

125
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,080
(what I said in the last lifetime.)

126
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:14,360
Here.

127
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:15,920
(He's seen)

128
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,750
(these people suffering
before his eyes.)

129
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:20,600
Your Highness.

130
00:06:22,070 --> 00:06:23,160
The village I mentioned before

131
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,630
that was overlooked
is north of the city.

132
00:06:24,630 --> 00:06:25,360
Thank you.

133
00:06:25,390 --> 00:06:27,000
Why don't we finish up here

134
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,630
and send some officials over there?

135
00:06:28,750 --> 00:06:30,680
I'm worried
the displaced people may riot.

136
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:31,430
Here you go.

137
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,360
Thank you.

138
00:06:35,630 --> 00:06:36,680
Thank you.

139
00:06:38,190 --> 00:06:39,720
We're out of porridge.

140
00:06:40,870 --> 00:06:41,630
The government granary.

141
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:42,750
There must still be grain
in the government granary.

142
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:43,870
Everyone, come with me to the granary.

143
00:06:43,950 --> 00:06:44,830
Make them release the grain.

144
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:45,830
Come on!

145
00:06:46,630 --> 00:06:47,430
Let's go.

146
00:06:53,430 --> 00:06:54,240
Your Highness.

147
00:06:54,950 --> 00:06:55,750
They're killing people!

148
00:06:56,070 --> 00:06:56,680
Boqing!

149
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:57,040
Fu Yang!

150
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,160
Get them out of here!

151
00:07:06,190 --> 00:07:06,870
Watch out!

152
00:07:06,870 --> 00:07:07,430
Xiaoyuan!

153
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,040
He Xiaoyuan!

154
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,390
He Xiaoyuan!

155
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:50,920
You're bleeding.

156
00:07:59,040 --> 00:07:59,950
Why has Your Highness

157
00:08:00,830 --> 00:08:03,160
treated me with such contempt ever since

158
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:05,070
the flower-viewing banquet
three months ago?

159
00:08:06,750 --> 00:08:08,190
I never despised you.

160
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:09,600
Then why do you keep avoiding me

161
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,830
as though I were something to be feared?

162
00:08:18,830 --> 00:08:19,360
Fu Yang.

163
00:08:20,070 --> 00:08:21,430
I once truly loved you.

164
00:08:25,830 --> 00:08:27,070
But I won't anymore.

165
00:08:29,270 --> 00:08:30,870
I won't trouble you again.

166
00:08:32,030 --> 00:08:33,240
So please,

167
00:08:34,390 --> 00:08:35,670
don't come near me again.

168
00:08:37,630 --> 00:08:38,550
And don't

169
00:08:38,910 --> 00:08:40,270
get hurt or bleed for me again.

170
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:42,840
Why can't I love you anymore?

171
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:48,240
If Your Highness
has already decided to leave,

172
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:50,440
why were you

173
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:52,030
so worried about me just now?

174
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,320
I will never forget
that you saved my life.

175
00:09:00,390 --> 00:09:01,510
Whatever reward you want,

176
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:03,080
be it gold, silver, or a noble title,

177
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,270
you may ask
for any of them in the future.

178
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,790
I'll personally
ask Father to grant it to you.

179
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:10,030
I want none of those.

180
00:09:12,210 --> 00:09:14,860
♪The breeze turns
the pages bearing our names♪

181
00:09:14,860 --> 00:09:17,850
♪Letters rewritten a thousand times♪

182
00:09:18,260 --> 00:09:24,270
♪Words left unspoken,
drowned instead in wine♪

183
00:09:24,530 --> 00:09:27,270
♪Who misread the words
within the books?♪

184
00:09:28,150 --> 00:09:29,360
This is

185
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:31,870
the reward I want.

186
00:09:31,870 --> 00:09:35,550
♪Every word is a wish for your peace♪

187
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:39,690
♪Every telling of our story
is filled with regret♪

188
00:09:39,690 --> 00:09:42,060
♪It's all because I like you♪

189
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:43,150
In that case,

190
00:09:44,550 --> 00:09:45,670
we're even now.

191
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:46,630
What?

192
00:09:47,270 --> 00:09:48,600
From now on, we'll each go

193
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:50,000
our own way.

194
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:52,130
♪If loving each other
only leaves us torn♪

195
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:54,270
Study Companion Fu,
please conduct yourself properly.

196
00:09:55,540 --> 00:10:00,170
♪In this life, I wish you peace♪

197
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:07,120
♪In this life, I wish you peace♪

198
00:10:24,220 --> 00:10:25,180
(Yanzhou Government Office)

199
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,360
Open the gates!

200
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,870
- Open up!
- Open up!

201
00:10:28,320 --> 00:10:30,440
- Open up! Open the gates!
- Open the gates!

202
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,440
- Open up!
- Open up!

203
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:32,510
Open the granary and release the grain!

204
00:10:33,390 --> 00:10:34,550
Open up!

205
00:10:34,910 --> 00:10:36,120
What are we going to do
if this continues?

206
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:37,790
More and more
displaced people are arriving.

207
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:39,000
If the imperial court
doesn't send help soon,

208
00:10:39,270 --> 00:10:40,360
we won't be able
to hold out much longer.

209
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,600
There must be grain inside.

210
00:10:42,670 --> 00:10:44,080
Everyone, break down the gate!

211
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,540
Open the gate!

212
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:47,240
Open the gate!

213
00:10:51,150 --> 00:10:51,720
Here.

214
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:52,720
Let me take a look.

215
00:10:52,910 --> 00:10:53,510
It hurts.

216
00:10:55,230 --> 00:10:56,020
It hurts.

217
00:10:59,670 --> 00:11:01,480
Your Highness, the government office has
been surrounded by displaced people.

218
00:11:01,630 --> 00:11:03,030
I'll return to the palace
and request reinforcements at once.

219
00:11:03,030 --> 00:11:03,720
Go.

220
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:04,150
Yes.

221
00:11:12,630 --> 00:11:13,720
The poison from this wound

222
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:15,240
is spreading quickly.

223
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:17,360
I need to scrape out the poison.

224
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:22,910
Bear with it.

225
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:21,200
♪Cause and effect scatter with the wind♪

226
00:12:22,130 --> 00:12:25,310
♪Where can this
longing heart find its home?♪

227
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,120
It's done.

228
00:12:26,510 --> 00:12:27,120
It's done.

229
00:12:28,560 --> 00:12:33,330
♪The past has become a series of trials♪

230
00:12:33,590 --> 00:12:39,030
♪Who can live this life
without failing those they love?♪

231
00:12:39,180 --> 00:12:41,840
♪The flickering lights
cast overlapping shadows♪

232
00:12:41,980 --> 00:12:44,610
♪Through each trial and thought,
the years pass by♪

233
00:12:44,770 --> 00:12:47,370
♪A cold blade gleams
against the frost and snow♪

234
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,390
I told you to leave.

235
00:12:50,080 --> 00:12:51,080
Why did you come back?

236
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:53,200
♪Old dreams scatter,
blood turning to snow♪

237
00:12:53,670 --> 00:12:54,870
Because

238
00:12:55,790 --> 00:12:57,270
I can't

239
00:12:58,480 --> 00:13:00,390
lose you again.

240
00:13:04,790 --> 00:13:06,270
(Lose me again?)

241
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:07,750
(What exactly)

242
00:13:08,030 --> 00:13:08,910
(has she been through?)

243
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:11,790
He Xiaoyuan.

244
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:14,360
If everything you've told me is true,

245
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:17,720
then what exactly

246
00:13:19,870 --> 00:13:21,320
have you and I been through?

247
00:13:31,380 --> 00:13:33,700
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

248
00:13:34,060 --> 00:13:35,740
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

249
00:13:36,380 --> 00:13:39,380
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

250
00:13:39,900 --> 00:13:44,220
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

251
00:13:44,220 --> 00:13:46,980
♪My heart has long known♪

252
00:13:47,420 --> 00:13:49,420
♪We made a promise long ago♪

253
00:13:49,740 --> 00:13:51,340
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

254
00:13:52,020 --> 00:13:55,340
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

255
00:13:55,660 --> 00:13:58,500
♪How much must I let go♪

256
00:13:58,820 --> 00:14:00,500
♪For one moment♪

257
00:14:00,780 --> 00:14:03,500
♪To hold each other close♪

258
00:14:03,740 --> 00:14:08,060
♪Would that be enough?♪
